From 411d2dab8d5d9c1b394ff935c6e33112e7615a5e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Piotr Oniszczuk <piotr.oniszczuk@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 16:15:08 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 16/17] phy: amlogic: add Amlogic S6 USB2/USB3 PHY driver

The S6 has two CRG USB controllers. Each has a USB2 PHY, and the second
one is also paired with a USB3 PHY. Add a driver for both, based on the
PHY initialization sequences of the vendor BSP:

 - USB2: reset sequence, efuse based trim, disconnect/squelch tuning, PLL
   enable, host/device/otg mode and VBUS regulator handling
 - USB3: reset/APB handling, hardware or software PLL configuration, efuse
   trim and TX/RX calibration, low power state when unused

Resets are taken from the reset controller instead of poking the shared
reset registers directly.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: Piotr Oniszczuk <piotr.oniszczuk@gmail.com>
---
